  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "The compiler builds the whole tree since the life family (ontology round R8, gate round 8). The replacement is Conclave Mentor's shape on the life lane: GAIN_LIFE of QProp(event, AMOUNT) + 1, the replaced amount now published by the executor (verbs._v_gain_life); a gain of 0 is no event (CR 119.10). The +2/+2 static reads FAtomPred.LIFE_TOTAL_GE(YOU, 25), the life total now (the card's ruling for formats not starting at 20). Pack tools/scenarios/mapped/M20/angel_of_vitality_plus_one_reaches_25_life.json (21 + 3 + 1 = 25, a 4/4 Angel). One lifelink source dealing damage to several recipients at once is one life-gain event (its ruling), so the +1 applies once: the engine gains once per source since the lifelink fix of gate round 8 (DESIGN_ATOM_ONTOLOGY §12 R8-4; pack tools/scenarios/mapped/M20/angel_of_vitality_and_twinblade_one_gain_for_a_trampler.json, a trampler over a 0/2: 20 -> 26)."
